Package: tintfetch
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests: hyfetch, pciutils, x11-xserver-utils
Description: display system information with colorful distribution artwork
 Tintfetch displays operating system, hardware and desktop information.
 It includes native HyFetch color profiles and fastfetch-style information
 modules, with plain text and JSON output. Optional external applications
 provide additional rendering backends.
